  "title": "Decision EE-103: typed ontology relations and a generated noun graph",
  "body": "Adds typed relations between nouns in `docs/ontology.json` (SKOS broader, narrower, related, plus part-of and derived-from), validated by `schema/check-nouns.mjs`, with `docs/noun-graph.md` generated by `node schema/check-nouns.mjs --graph` (tests fail if it is stale). 90 seed relations. Six marketing frames now use the function id `marketing-and-sales`.\n\nFlag for review: the `fund-without-ceding-control` frame lists `governance`, which is not a function id; left unchanged.\n\nBuilt by cloud agent bc-5406178a (its PR tool failed with `[unavailable] Error`, so this was opened by Grok Bot at Torian's direction). The anticipation ontology change (EE-104) stacks on this branch.",
